Source: pg-graphql
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, clang, rustc
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/supabase/pg_graphql

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-graphql
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-graphql
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GraphQL support for PostgreSQL
 pg_graphql reflects a GraphQL schema from the existing PostgreSQL schema and
 resolves queries inside the database server. This package builds PostgreSQL
 14 through 18. The shipped catalog edge starts at extension version 1.6.1;
 older catalogs require a separately audited path. Disconnect old backends or
 restart PostgreSQL before relying on the 1.6.2 query-depth security limit.
